### Direct calls to client-service (port 8082)

### 1. All customers
GET http://localhost:8082/clients

### 2. Search by name / CIN / email
GET http://localhost:8082/clients?nom=ben
###
GET http://localhost:8082/clients?cin=0912

### 3. Detail (200) / unknown (404)
GET http://localhost:8082/clients/1
###
GET http://localhost:8082/clients/999

### 4. Eligibility: OK (1), too young (5), expired licence (6)
GET http://localhost:8082/clients/1/eligibilite
###
GET http://localhost:8082/clients/5/eligibilite
###
GET http://localhost:8082/clients/6/eligibilite

### 5. Create (201)
POST http://localhost:8082/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cin": "12345678",
  "nom": "Kharrat",
  "prenom": "Omar",
  "dateNaissance": "2000-05-10",
  "email": "omar.test@mail.tn",
  "telephone": "21612345678",
  "adresse": "Ariana",
  "numeroPermis": "TN-200001",
  "dateExpirationPermis": "2030-01-01"
}

### 6. Duplicate CIN (409)
POST http://localhost:8082/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cin": "09123456", "nom": "X", "prenom": "Y", "dateNaissance": "1990-01-01",
  "email": "new@mail.tn", "numeroPermis": "TN-999999", "dateExpirationPermis": "2030-01-01"
}

### 7. Invalid data (400): CIN 3 digits, bad email, birth date in the future
POST http://localhost:8082/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cin": "123", "nom": "X", "prenom": "Y", "dateNaissance": "2099-01-01",
  "email": "pas-un-email", "numeroPermis": "TN-1", "dateExpirationPermis": "2030-01-01"
}

### 8. Change loyalty category
PATCH http://localhost:8082/clients/2/categorie
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categorie": "FIDELE" }

### 9. Delete (needs location-service running, else 503)
DELETE http://localhost:8082/clients/2
